SUMMARY:IMPROMPTU: 55 or 34 miles (H) Head for the Hills (revised) from GA
 P
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader: Lynn Pfeil\n
 \nThis is a training ride for a few of us participating in America's Most 
 Beautiful Bike Ride for Blood Cancer United\, in Lake Tahoe on June 7th bu
 t **ALL ARE WELCOME**! Our pace will probably be about 13 but you can ride
  FASTER! This is a revision of Head for the Hills\, from GAP. This beautif
 ul ride takes us to Octorara Creek/Wolf's Hollow Park\, for some terrific 
 climbing! We're doing 55 but there is a 34 mile cut off that still include
 s all that beauty and climbing!\n55 mile route: https://ridewithgps.com/ro
 utes/54703383\n34 mile route: https://ridewithgps.com/routes/54757043\nThe
 re are several rest stops along the way on either version.\nJOIN US!\n\nIn
 terested in **donating to Blood Cancer United** (formerly the Leukemia and
  Lymphoma Society)? http://tinyurl.com/tahoe26\n\nInterested in **joining 
 us in Lake Tahoe**? [https://pages.lls.org/events/home/ambbr2026#register-
 section](https://pages.lls.org/events/home/ambbr2026#register-section)\n\n
 Helmets are mandatory. No ear buds. Please bring water and a basic repair 
 kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\nTo eliminate passing 
 around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup 
 RSVP below to join this ride.\nBeing on Meetup does not mean you are a clu
 b member. [Join here](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_
 id=60&club_id=257148).\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's
  [Code of Conduct](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_
 id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984) \,\n[Rules of the Road](https://lan
 cbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id
 =325159) \, and [Ride Waiver](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=4
 54318)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3144057
 03/
