SUMMARY:B/B+ Elizabethtown to MayTown Loop (R40)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Ride leader: Gavin Robe
 rtson**\n\n**Anticipated Average Pace: 17-19 mph**\n\n**Route: [https://ri
 dewithgps.com/routes/54743220](https://ridewithgps.com/routes/54743220)**\
 n\nThis is a B/B+ (16-19 mph average) level ride. The ride leader will rid
 e at the advertised average speed. This is intended to be a group ride wit
 h a no-drop rule as the main goal. The ride leader will do his best to kee
 p the group together with occasional regroupings and a sweeper may also be
  appointed at the start. Please do not join this ride if you are not willi
 ng to ride with the group. If you exceed the posted pace\, you will be rid
 ing by yourself and encouraged to join a faster group. If maintaining a 16
 -19 mph average is beyond your current ability level\, please consider joi
 ning a slower ride first.\n\n**Helmets are mandatory\; No ear buds or audi
 ble music playing devices. Please bring water\, and a basic repair kit (sp
 are tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).**\n\nTo eliminate passing aro
 und a pen and paper waiver\, we encourage LBC Club membership and Meetup R
 SVP below to join this ride. RSVP also allows us to contact you after the 
 ride if needed. If you do not RSVP you are not covered by the club excess 
 accident insurance policy\; only club members who RSVP are covered. Being 
 on Meetup does not mean you are a club member. Join here- [https://www.lan
 casterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148](https://www.lan
 casterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n\nYour RSVP is
  your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct: [https://lancbikec
 lub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=32398
 4](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=25
 7148&module_id=323984)\n\nRules of the Road: [https://lancbikeclub.clubexp
 ress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159](https://
 lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module
 _id=325159)\n\nRide Waiver: [https://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=76
 3523](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=763523)
