SUMMARY:LBC Bike to 30K Program: Roadside Maintenance with Trek Bikes 
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nThe Bike to 30K is hostin
 g a class with Trek Bikes on Roadside Maintenance. Join us for this inform
 ational program on changing a flat and more!\n\n**Grab your helmets\, bike
 s\, and sneakers — Lancaster Bicycle Club is gearing up for beginner and
  transitional rides!** Local members of the LBC are thrilled to host this 
 year’s **Bike to 30K Program**\, designed especially for new\, returning
 \, and curious cyclists.\n\n## **About the Program**\n\nBike to 30K is a s
 even‑week series that gently builds your confidence\, fitness\, and mile
 age. We begin with a five‑mile ride and gradually work up to eighteen mi
 les by the end of the program. Our goal is simple: to introduce riders of 
 all experience levels to the joy of cycling in a supportive\, community‑
 focused environment.\nThis program is **FREE** with an LBC membership — 
 and membership is also free. The Bike to 30K program is open to everyone i
 n our community who wants to ride.\n\n## **Why We Ride**\n\nEver wonder wh
 y cyclists keep coming back? Because it’s fun. There’s nothing like co
 asting downhill and letting out a big “weeeeeee” all the way to the bo
 ttom. But we also know that if you’re new to cycling\, jumping straight 
 into an 18‑mile ride can feel intimidating. That’s exactly why Bike to
  30K exists.\nEach week\, you’ll increase your mileage at a comfortable 
 pace. You’ll get to know the club\, meet fellow riders\, and gradually g
 row into a confident **Fun Rider** — the group known for enjoying scenic
 \, social rides together.\n\n## **Our Commitment to You**\n\nLancaster Bic
 ycle Club is dedicated to supporting new riders and helping our community 
 reach their cycling goals. Bike to 30K is part of our initiative to encour
 age more people to get outside\, get active\, and discover how enjoyable c
 ycling can be.\nSpend seven weeks with us and watch yourself transform int
 o a Fun Rider — one mile at a time.\nThe Bike to 30K program is voluntar
 y\, welcoming\, and designed with beginners in mind. We can’t wait to ri
 de with you.\n\n## **Membership\, Waiver & RSVP Requirements**\n\nTo elimi
 nate passing around a pen‑and‑paper waiver\, we require both:\n\n* **L
 BC Club Membership**\, and\n* **Meetup RSVP**\n\nYour RSVP allows us to co
 ntact you after the ride if needed. Please note: **ONLY club members who R
 SVP are covered by the club’s excess accident insurance policy.** Being 
 on Meetup does *not* mean you are a club member. To join our wonderful clu
 b\, please sign up through our membership link.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3132641
 78/
