SUMMARY:IMPROMPTU LVRT - Colebrook Tavern Ride (30R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader: Bruce Black\
 n\n**PLEASE NOTE THE START TIME**\n\nAn enjoyable ride starting and ending
  at Lebanon Valley Rail Trail - Cornwall Trailhead and exploring the Cornw
 all and Mt. Gretna area. We will stop at Colebrook Tavern for lunch and th
 en meander back to the parking lot via the Lebanon Valley Rail Trail. The 
 pace will be 13 - 15 mph average with multiple regroup points (like 4 or 5
 ).\n\nThis ride is a social ride\, but cyclists are not expected to stay i
 n one group. Cyclists may pedal at their own comfortable paces. Please be 
 supportive of the other cyclists to avoid anyone biking alone or being dro
 pped off the back of the last group.\n\nCue and Ride with GPS links:\n[htt
 ps://ridewithgps.com/routes/54714924](https://ridewithgps.com/routes/54714
 924)\n\nHelmets are mandatory\; please also plan to bring 1-2 water bottle
 s\, and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).
 \nBeing a Meetup Member does not mean you are a club member. Use this link
  to join the club.\n[https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_i
 d=60&club_id=257148](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_i
 d=60&club_id=257148)\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's C
 ode of Conduct [https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=
 22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/c
 ontent.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\nand Rules of the 
 Road\n[https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?](https://lancbik
 eclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325
 159)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3143968
 65/
