SUMMARY:Phil's Hills: Speedwell Forge Repeats
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Ride Leader:** Phil New
 swanger\n\n**Phil’s Hills**: a series of structured hill repeat rides de
 signed to build strength\, endurance and boost your overall fitness.\n\n**
 Cue and GPX link:** [Phil's Hills: Speedwell Forge Repeats](https://ridewi
 thgps.com/routes/50354463)\n\nWhat to Expect:\n\n* **Route:** Expect a tot
 al distance of approximately **15-20 miles**\, including **3-4 loops** of 
 a circuit featuring **1-2 climbing segment**.\n* **Focus:** We'll emphasiz
 e maintaining a consistent climbing tempo\, active recovery between effort
 s\, and repeating the effort to build power and efficiency.\n* **Pace:** W
 e'll maintain a comfortable average pace range of **14-16 mph**.\n* **No-D
 rop Policy:** You'll never be left behind! We'll regroup after climbs to e
 nsure everyone stays together.\n\n\\-\\-\\-\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No e
 arbuds or audible music-playing devices. Please bring water\, and a basic 
 repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).
